    "name": "Translation + CLIR Drill",
    "text": "2\nTranslation + CLIR Drill\n1 SECTION\nInstructions\n\nStart a stopwatch.\n\nRead and translate the stimulus* out loud in chunks.\n\nQuip each chunk of the stimulus after you translate.\n\nContinue this process on every stimulus chunk until you reach the end of stimulus.\n\nImmediately proceed to the CLIR after your final quip of the stimulus (or the final quip is the CLIR).\n\nStop the stopwatch and record your time.\n\nSEE FULL WORKOUT DETAILS",
