    "name": "Failsafe Marathon",
    "text": "3\nFailsafe Marathon\n8 SECTIONS\nInstructions\n\nNOTE: You can do a Failsafe Marathon with any Workout. Failsafes are time-training protocols that you can apply to any Workout.\n\nAim to complete six to eight LR Failsafes* in one sitting with no breaks, or complete six to eight RC Failsafes in one sitting with no breaks.\n\nAs you complete the Failsafes successfully during the Marathon, progress the Failsafe goals according to the Accuracy Failsafe instructions or the Timing Failsafe instructions.\n\nIf you do not meet your goal on one of the Failsafe sections, the Marathon is over. Follow the Accuracy Failsafe instructions or the Timing Failsafe instructions for the next steps on what to do when you don't meet your Failsafe goal.\n\nSEE FULL WORKOUT DETAILS",
