    "name": "Camo Review",
    "text": "4\nCamo Review\nInstructions\n\nWhen you finish an LR or RC section in LawHub, do not press Complete Section. Instead, write down your answers.\n\nUse Self-Paced Mode on all LR and RC sections. Never use Exam Mode.\n\nAt least 24 hours later, enter your answers into Camo Review.\n\nDo not check your answers against the answer key before entering your answers into Camo Review.\n\nCamo Review will give you a list of questions to return to.\n\nThis list includes all of your wrong answers and an unknown number of decoy correct answers.\n\nReattempt all of the questions in your Camo Review from scratch. Attempt to do a better job on the question now than you did the first time.\n\nDoing a better job means you should retranslate, requip, and re-CLIR the stimulus on LR or retranslate and requip the passage on RC. Retranslate every part of the question, consider every answer choice, and try to correct your process mistakes before choosing a new answer.\n\nEnter all your new answers into Camo Review.\n\nCamo Review will identify all your Misreads, Conceptual Gaps, Self-Doubt, and Self-Confidence answers.\n\nYour Misreads, Conceptual Gaps, and Self-Doubt answers have been automatically added to your Wrong Answer Journal. Go to your Wrong Answer Journal now to immediately begin the Wrong Answer Journal process.\n\nSEE FULL WORKOUT DETAILS",
