ever use Exam Mode.</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>At least 24 hours later, enter your answers into Camo Review.</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Do not check your answers against the answer key before entering your answers into Camo Review.</strong></li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Camo Review will give you a list of questions to return to.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>This list includes all of your wrong answers and an unknown number of decoy correct answers.</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Reattempt all of the questions in your Camo Review from scratch. Attempt to do a better job on the&nbsp;question now than you did the&nbsp;first time.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Doing a better job means you should retranslate, requip, and re-CLIR the stimulus on LR or retranslate and requip the passage on RC. Retranslate every part of the question, consider every answer choice, and try to correct your process mistakes before choosing a new answer.</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Enter all your new answers into Camo Review.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Camo Review will identify all your Misreads, Conceptual Gaps, Self-Doubt, and Self-Confidence answers.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Your Misreads, Conceptual Gaps, and Self-Doubt answers have been automatically added to your Wrong Answer Journal. Go to your Wrong Answer Journal now to immediately begin the Wrong Answer Journal process.</p>\n</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"pt-2\"><a href=\"/workouts-and-routines/workouts/camo-review\"><button class=\"\n    inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-full\n    font-extrabold uppercase lh-outline\n    [transition:background-color_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1),border-color_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1),box-shadow_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1),translate_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1)]\n    disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50\n   \n          border-black text-black\n          hover:not-disabled:-translate-x-[3px]\n          hover:not-disabled:-translate-y-[3px]\n          hover:not-disabled:shadow-[3px_3px_0_0_#1