    "name": "Wrong Answer Journal",
    "text": "5\nWrong Answer Journal\nInstructions\n\nAfter you've Camoed your LR or RC section, begin the Wrong Answer Journaling process.\n\nFor each wrong answer, fill in the date you did the section, the question number that was wrong, and the answer you chose.\n\nThis information will already be filled in for you if you Camo using Loophole Online.\n\nFill in your Reason Missed column\n\nIn this column, write down what you did wrong that caused you to miss this question.\n\nAsk yourself, \"Why did I think that this wrong answer was right? Why did I think that this right answer was wrong?\" Focus on changing the actions that enabled these mistaken judgments.\n\nThe first word of every entry in this column should be \"I.\" \n\nExample: \"I misidentified the question stem.\"\n\nThis will force you to reflect on what you did that caused you to choose the wrong answer and overlook the right answer.\n\nFill in your Solution column\n\nIn this column, write down what you will do differently to ensure you don't make this same mistake again.\n\nAsk yourself, \"What could I have done that would have made me realize in the moment that the wrong answer is wrong? What could I have done that would have made me realize in the moment that the right answer is right?\"\n\nThe first words of every entry in this column should be \"I will...\" \n\nExample: \"I will do Question Stem Training to improve my ability to correctly identify question types.\"\n\nFrame your Solution Column as a direct response to the Reason Missed column.\n\nClick here to go to your Wrong Answer Journal\n\nSEE FULL WORKOUT DETAILS",
    "html": "<div data-slot=\"table-row\" role=\"row\" class=\"col-span-full overflow-hidden\" style=\"height: 663.79px; box-sizing: content-box; transform: none; margin-left: -1rem; margin-right: -1rem; margin-top: -0.25rem; background-color: var(--color-seafoam-lc); box-shadow: 0 0 0 0px var(--color-soft-black), 0px 0px 0 0 var(--color-soft-black), inset 0 0 0 4px var(--color-soft-black); z-index: 1; border-radius: 12px;\"><div class=\"grid self-start\" style=\"grid-template-columns: minmax(0px, 100%); opacity: 1; transition: opacity 0.15s;\"><div class=\"col-span-full p-1\"><div data-testid=\"schedule-expanded-card\" class=\"flex h-full flex-col rounded-xl bg-white\"><div class=\"\n          flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 px-4 pt-4 pb-3\n          md:px-6 md:pt-6 md:pb-4\n        \"><div class=\"\n            flex items-center gap-3\n            md:gap-5\n          \"><div class=\"inline-flex min-h-7 min-w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-soft-black px-1 text-caption-large font-black text-soft-black transition-shadow duration-300 bg-soft-white size-12 shrink-0 bg-chartreuse! text-body-m! font-extrabold!\" role=\"status\">5</div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5\"><h3 class=\"text-body-l font-bold text-soft-black\">Wrong Answer Journal</h3></div></div><button class=\"\n    inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-full\n    font-extrabold uppercase lh-outline\n    [transition:background-color_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1),border-color_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1),box-shadow_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1),translate_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1)]\n    disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50\n   \n          border-black bg-soft-white text-black\n          hover:not-disabled:-translate-x-[3px]\n          hover:not-disabled:-translate-y-[3px] hover:not-disabled:bg-soft-white\n          hover:not-disabled:shadow-[3px_3px_0_0_#171712]\n          active:not-disabled:-translate-x-[1px]\n          active:not-disabled:-translate-y-[1px]\n          active:not-disabled:shadow-[1px_1px_0_0_#171712]\n         h-[38px] gap-2 text-caption-medium border-[2px] !size-9.5 !gap-0 !px-0 -translate-x-[3px] -translate-y-[3px] shadow-[3px_3px_0_0_#171712] \n          h-8! w-11.5! shrink-0!\n          group-hover/expandable:-translate-x-[3px]\n          group-hover/expandable:-translate-y-[3px]\n          group-hover/expandable:bg-soft-white\n          group-hover/expandable:shadow-[3px_3px_0_0_#171712]\n          group-has-[[data-no-expand]:hover]/expandable:translate-x-0!\n          group-has-[[data-no-expand]:hover]/expandable:translate-y-0!\n          group-has-[[data-no-expand]:hover]/expandable:shadow-none!\n          peer-hover/bookmark:translate-x-0! peer-hover/bookmark:translate-y-0!\n          peer-hover/bookmark:shadow-none!\n          hover:-translate-x-[3px] hover:-translate-y-[3px] hover:bg-soft-white\n          hover:shadow-[3px_3px_0_0_#171712]\n         \n            shrink-0 self-start\n            lg:h-11! lg:w-15.5\n          \" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Close view\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><span class=\"flex items-center justify-center\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"transform: rotate(180deg);\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-testid=\"lucide-chevron-down-icon\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></div></span></button></div><div class=\"\n          flex flex-col gap-2 px-4 pb-4\n          md:px-8 md:pb-6\n        \"><h4 class=\"text-body-l font-extrabold text-soft-black\">Instructions</h4><div class=\"prose text-body-s\"><ol>\n<li>\n<p>After you've Camoed your LR or RC section, begin the&nbsp;Wrong Answer Journaling process.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>For each wrong answer, fill in the date you did the section, the question number that was wrong, and the answer you chose.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>This information will already be filled in for you if you Camo using Loophole Online.</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Fill in your Reason Missed column</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>In this column, write down <strong>what you did wrong that caused you to miss this question</strong>.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Ask yourself, \"Why did I think that this wrong answer was right? Why did I think that this right answer was wrong?\" Focus on changing the actions that enabled these mistaken judgments.</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The first word of every entry in this column should be \"I.\"&nbsp;</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Example: \"I misidentified the&nbsp;question stem.\"</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>This will force you to reflect on <strong>what&nbsp;you&nbsp;did</strong> that caused you to choose the wrong answer and overlook the right answer.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Fill in your Solution column</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>In this column, write down <strong>what you will do differently to ensure you don't make this same mistake again</strong>.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Ask yourself, \"What could I have done that would have made me realize in the moment that the wrong answer is wrong? What could I have done that would have made me realize in the moment that the right answer is right?\"</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The first words of every entry in this column should be \"I will...\"&nbsp;</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Example: \"I will do Question Stem Training to improve my ability to correctly identify question types.\"</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Frame your Solution Column as a direct response to the Reason Missed column.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Click <a href=\"https://new.theloophole.com/review-and-camo/wrong-answer-journal\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> to go to your Wrong Answer Journal</p></div><div class=\"pt-2\"><a href=\"/workouts-and-routines/workouts/wrong-answer-journal\"><button class=\"\n    inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-full\n    font-extrabold uppercase lh-outline\n    [transition:background-color_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1),border-color_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1),box-shadow_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1),translate_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1)]\n    disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50\n   \n          border-black text-black\n          hover:not-disabled:-translate-x-[3px]\n          hover:not-disabled:-translate-y-[3px]\n          hover:not-disabled:shadow-[3px_3px_0_0_#171712]\n          active:not-disabled:-translate-x-[1px]\n          active:not-disabled:-translate-y-[1px]\n          active:not-disabled:shadow-[1px_1px_0_0_#171712]\n         h-[38px] gap-2 text-caption-medium border-[2px] pl-4 pr-3\">See full workout details<span class=\"flex items-center justify-center\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"12\" class=\"\" viewBox=\"0 0 26 19\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-testid=\"arrow-icon\"><path d=\"M20.25 10.9383H1.66667C1.19444 10.9383 0.798611 10.7786 0.479167 10.4592C0.159722 10.1397 0 9.74389 0 9.27167C0 8.79945 0.159722 8.40361 0.479167 8.08417C0.798611 7.76472 1.19444 7.605 1.66667 7.605H20.25L15.5 2.855C15.1667 2.52167 15.0069 2.13278 15.0208 1.68833C15.0347 1.24389 15.1944 0.855 15.5 0.521667C15.8333 0.188333 16.2292 0.0147222 16.6875 0.000833333C17.1458 -0.0130556 17.5417 0.146667 17.875 0.48L25.5 8.105C25.6667 8.27167 25.7847 8.45222 25.8542 8.64667C25.9236 8.84111 25.9583 9.04945 25.9583 9.27167C25.9583 9.49389 25.9236 9.70222 25.8542 9.89667C25.7847 10.0911 25.6667 10.2717 25.5 10.4383L17.875 18.0633C17.5417 18.3967 17.1458 18.5564 16.6875 18.5425C16.2292 18.5286 15.8333 18.355 15.5 18.0217C15.1944 17.6883 15.0347 17.2994 15.0208 16.855C15.0069 16.4106 15.1667 16.0217 15.5 15.6883L20.25 10.9383Z\" fill=\"#171712\"></path></svg></span></button></a></div></div></div></div></div></div>",
